OL,3,CPopular Mumbles cafe devastated by
OL,4,Cfire could be shut for nearly a year
OL,6,FThe manager of an iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,7,Fhas announced that the venue could be
OL,8,Fshut until Easter next year.
OL,10,FIt comes after the popular Verdi's
OL,11,FCafe was devastated by an overnight
OL,12,Ffire last month, resulting in an
OL,13,Fimmediate closure.
OL,15,FIn an emotional video published on
OL,16,FVerdi's social media, the venue's
OL,17,Fgeneral manager, Guiseppe Cianciarulo,
OL,18,Fis seen in the cafe, surrounded by
OL,19,Fdamage.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
