OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F435A1786628948
OL,3,CPopular Mumbles cafe devastated by
OL,4,Cfire could be shut for nearly a year
OL,6,FIn the post, Mr Cianciarulo describes
OL,7,Fthe situation as "heartbreaking" with
OL,8,Fa "long journey ahead".
OL,10,FHe said: "The bosses are looking after
OL,11,Fus and will try to reopen the venue as
OL,12,Fsoon as possible, but it's going to be
OL,13,Fhard to see us before the end of the
OL,14,Fyear, maybe even Easter.
OL,16,F"We just hope to reopen as soon as
OL,17,Fpossible. The most important people of
OL,18,FVerdi's are you customers that come
OL,19,Fthrough the door.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
