OL,3,CPopular Mumbles cafe devastated by
OL,4,Cfire could be shut for nearly a year
OL,6,F"Hopefully by 2027 we will make it
OL,7,Fbetter than before."
OL,9,FVerdi's was operated by the Moruzzi
OL,10,Ffamily for generations before being
OL,11,Ftaken over by the Hole family in 2023.
OL,13,FKnown for its panoramic views of
OL,14,FSwansea Bay, Verdi's is popular for
OL,15,Fits ice cream and Italian food.
